#: templates/_settings_tabs/scraping.html:318
msgid ""
"Each person can add their own in Settings > Account > My Profile, and "
"theirs is used first. The household's here is used only for someone who "
"has not added their own."
msgstr ""
"Кожен може додати свій у Налаштування > Обліковий запис > Мій профіль, і "
